    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aStory\u300b</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294080/extras/8656d27a037edd9304be44dce7556bbd.poster.avif?t=1753437235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294080/extras/8656d27a037edd9304be44dce7556bbd.webm?t=1753437235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294080/extras/8656d27a037edd9304be44dce7556bbd.mp4?t=1753437235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>I, Takeo Kashima, am currently taking a short break in the office of a hot spring inn.<br>That inn is where I grew up.<br><br>My parents are away from the inn for a few days to attend some sort of meeting in town.<br>With two pairs of hands gone, this small inn can't keep up with all the work. That's why I was called in for the summer.<br><br>&quot;Oh? Tired already?&quot;<br><br>The person who appears at the door is Yukari Kashima.<br>She's my older brother's wife, or in other words, my sister-in-law.<br>Right now, she's working as the proprietress of this inn.<br><br>&quot;Or\u2026 is it that you can't get motivated without a reward?<br>If you want, I could give you one!&quot;<br><br>My brother\u2026 passed away last year due to illness.<br>That makes Yukari a widow.<br>In light of that, I think it's inappropriate for her to joke around like this.<br>In front of the guests, she's ever the gentle and elegant hostess, but\u2026 she's always like this with me.<br><br>That night\u2026 I get lost in thought while soaking in the open-air bath, the pride of the inn.<br>As I gaze up at the starry night sky while soaking in the tub, someone enters the bath.<br><br>&quot;Uh\u2026 Yukari? Wh-why are you here?&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aCharacters\u300b</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294080/extras/a70e74e47e01aed4584489e24466c7ff.poster.avif?t=1753437235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294080/extras/a70e74e47e01aed4584489e24466c7ff.webm?t=1753437235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294080/extras/a70e74e47e01aed4584489e24466c7ff.mp4?t=1753437235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Yukari Kashima (VA: Riko Amamori)</strong><br>Takeo's sister-in-law.<br>Since Takeo's brother passed away, she is a widow.<br>She's prone to joking around as a way to cope with her husband's death.<br>She's actually quite shy.<br>She's such a lightweight that just one small cup of booze is enough to get her drunk.<br><br>*Before purchasing this product, we highly recommend that you play the demo [Japanese only] to check if the game works properly on your computer in your region.<br>*Appetite is the licensor of this game. For inquiries about the product, please contact Tensei Games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aContents\u300b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 separate CGs (Over 80 CGs in total!)</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>15 H-scenes</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Japanese voice acting for the main female character</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300aFeatures\u300b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You can have the same experience as the protagonist.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two endings</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>CG Gallery Mode</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Scene Replay Mode</li></ul>",
